  text: "i can’t believe this is free...\n\ni spent 15+ hours and $478 in API credits\
    \ figuring out \n\nhow to make GPT Image 2.5 produce agency-quality product shots,\
    \ app ,webmockups... \n\n[now you can steal the entire workflow: ↓]\n\n→ 5 agent\
    \ skills for reconstruction, editing, reverse-engineering, mixing references,\
    \ and checking + fixing results\n\n→ a 50-page visual guide, the full illustrated\
    \ article, and 12 visual explainers\n\n→ 95 saved prompts, a searchable library,\
    \ and 44 illustrated studies\n\n→ interactive image maps, reusable JSON, Python\
    \ tools, source images, before/afters, experiment records, and repair logs\n\n\
    product shots. ads. app and website mockups. posters. infographics.\n\nthe source\
    \ code and downloadable skill packs are included. \n\ninstall them in Codex or\
    \ Claude Code, add your references, and let your agent build the prompts."
